<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tom Meo Meo</title>
<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101020, #24244a);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
}
header {
    padding: 30px 15px;
    background: #17172b;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #8b5cf6;
}
h1 {
    color: #b99aff;
    margin: 0;
}
.container {
    padding: 25px 15px;
}
.card {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 25px;
    background: #20203a;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #6550a5;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #6d28d933;
}
button {
    background: #8b5cf6;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
}
button:hover {
    background: #7040d8;
}
footer {
    padding: 20px;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 13px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <h1>🐱 TOM MEO MEO</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my website</p>
</header>
<div class="container">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Xin chào!</h2>
        <p>Chào mừng bạn đến với website Tom Meo Meo.</p>
        <button onclick="alert('Chào mừng đến với Tom Meo Meo!')">
            Bấm vào đây
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
<footer>© 2026 Tom Meo Meo</footer>
</body>
</html>
